WEBVTT

00:05:29.699 --> 00:05:33.175
Well, the Earth -- our environment,
in the form of us --

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.115
is creating knowledge.

00:05:35.139 --> 00:05:36.479
Well, what does that mean?

00:05:36.503 --> 00:05:40.209
Well, look out even further
than we've just been --

00:05:40.233 --> 00:05:42.360
I mean from here, with a telescope --

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:46.587
and you'll see things that look
like stars, they're called quasars.

00:05:46.611 --> 00:05:49.735
"Quasars" originally meant
"quasi-stellar object,"

00:05:49.759 --> 00:05:52.655
which means "things that look
a bit like stars."

00:05:52.679 --> 00:05:54.004
(Laughter)

00:05:54.028 --> 00:05:55.228
But they're not stars.

00:05:55.252 --> 00:05:57.804
And we know what they are.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.829
Billions of years ago
and billions of light-years away,